# reactions_melee.tscn's reactions, as a rules sheet (CbRules: docs/looks.md, Rules sheets). Plain paths are
# from the scene's root.

# Swing
on melee.swing
	subject $at
	at $at/RightHand
	sound res://assets/sfx/melee_swing.wav volume -6 jitter 0.08 range 30

# Hit: whatever the swing found (the sheet's melee.hit, predicted: heard at once). (Until M282 the
# server said it, louder on a player, by its damage; a find's event has none.)
on melee.hit
	subject $at
	at point
	sound res://assets/sfx/melee_bat_hit.wav volume -4 jitter 0.12 range 40
